      app from https://github.com/ArrestedOps/ha-stups, or as the published container image) for
      your own use: in your household, or inside your own organisation for its internal
      purposes. Downloading or cloning the repository or the images by Home Assistant (the
      Supervisor), Docker or a comparable tool for the purpose of this installation and for
      updates is part of this permission;
   b) read the source code, for example to understand how it works, to check its security, or to
      report a problem to the licensor;
   c) keep the copies that are technically necessary to run the Software and make backups of your
      own data (for example the data folder of the app).

